{"text":"We be too cool, we be hot, we be beautiful, full of it. We flood our lips with Vaseline and singe the hair into what should have been a birthright. Jazz and smoke soak stick in the air but not deep enough to drown our voices, floating like clumps of crows, tossed wingless so the gossip has no choice but to perch soft on all of our padded shoulders. Leanne steps inside, the parlor swallows that thin child hole like paper round rock. Sit down here sister, you're busy already with Nina, let me, nah, she wants an updo, I got you, honey. Yolanda wins the battle, blow dry her howl purring as she glitters about in a fur like red coat in a new African print jumpsuit. Soon, half of Leanne's hair is the Amazon rainforest and the other half, the rain. Stop fidgeting, we ain't done, we still got the kitchen.","words":[{"text":"We","start":1.18,"end":1.9},{"text":"be","start":1.9,"end":2.62},{"text":"too","start":2.62,"end":2.94},{"text":"cool","start":2.94,"end":3.38,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":4.1,"end":4.16},{"text":"be","start":4.16,"end":4.36},{"text":"hot","start":4.36,"end":4.68,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":4.9,"end":5.04},{"text":"be","start":5.04,"end":5.42},{"text":"beautiful","start":5.42,"end":6.28,"punct":","},{"text":"full","start":6.72,"end":7.14},{"text":"of","start":7.14,"end":7.3},{"text":"it","start":7.3,"end":7.5,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":7.96,"end":8.12},{"text":"flood","start":8.12,"end":8.58},{"text":"our","start":8.58,"end":8.8},{"text":"lips","start":8.8,"end":9.14},{"text":"with","start":9.14,"end":9.4},{"text":"Vaseline","start":9.4,"end":10.1},{"text":"and","start":10.1,"end":10.4},{"text":"singe","start":10.4,"end":10.8},{"text":"the","start":10.8,"end":10.94},{"text":"hair","start":10.94,"end":11.26},{"text":"into","start":11.26,"end":11.76},{"text":"what","start":11.76,"end":12.0},{"text":"should","start":12.0,"end":12.22},{"text":"have","start":12.22,"end":12.34},{"text":"been","start":12.34,"end":12.7},{"text":"a","sta